    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Restricted stock units (&quot;RSUs&quot;) were converted into common stock on a one-for-one basis.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Represents shares withheld to satisfy tax withholding obligations upon the vesting of RSUs awarded to the reporting person.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">The securities are RSUs units representing a contingent right to receive one share of Turtle Beach Corporation common stock or, cash with a value equal to the fair market value of the underlying common stock or, a combination thereof.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">These RSUs vest in equal quarterly installments until February 3, 2029.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">One-quarter of these RSUs will vest on April 1, 2027, with the remainder of the RSUs vesting in equal annual installments until April 1, 2030.</footnote>
    </footnotes>

